Ch1BeginningScene:
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy
ENUN
LOAD1 0 MainEnemy2
ENUN
CAM1 [15,17]
STAL 10
FADU 16
STAL 10
LOAD1 1 DaphneParty
ENUN
CUMO Daphne
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x910)
EndConvo
EVBIT_T 9
STAL 5
CUMO [13,19]
STAL 60
CURE
Text(0x912)
CAM1 [11,17]
MoveByCoords(60, 11, 17, 12, 19)
ENUN
Text(0x913)
STAL 10
MoveByCoords(60, 12, 19, 13, 8)
ENUN
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x914)
EndConvo
STAL 30
CAM1 Daphne
Text(0x911)
STAL 10
