SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x915)
EndConvo
CUMO Daphne
STAL 30
CURE
SetBackground(0x2)
Text(0x91E)
EndConvo
STAL 20
LOAD1 1 AltoParty
ENUN
CUMO Alto
STAL 60
CURE
SetBackground(0x5)
Text(0x91F)
ENDA

Ch1EndingScene:
FADI 16
CLEN Navarro
CLEA Daphne
CAM1 [13,3]
FADU 20
STAL 60
SetBackground(0xF)
CHECK_EXISTS Ernest
BNE 1 sC s0 //if Ernest is alive, jump to LABEL 1, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x938) //dead
GOTO 3
LABEL 1
CHECK_ALLEGIANCE Ernest
BEQ 2 sC s0 // if Ernest is allied, jump to LABEL 2, otherwise keep reading
Text(0x9F7) //alive but not allied
GOTO 3
LABEL 2
Text(0x937) //alive and allied
LABEL 3
MNC2 Ch2
ENDA

MESSAGE Events end at offset CURRENTOFFSET